      "text": "$XAUUSD\n\n📊 XAUUSD — MONDAY OPEN WATCH\n\nGold had a volatile week — sweeping lows down to the 4,000 psychological level before recovering back into the 4,020 - 4,060 range heading into the weekend close.\n\nNow as we head into Monday's open, price sits at a critical decision point. The 4,000 level has proven itself as a significant structural floor multiple times — but every test weakens it further.\n\nThe key levels to watch this week:\n\n🔼 Above 4,060 — bulls could push toward the 4,100 - 4,130 supply zone\n🔽 Below 4,000 — structure breaks and sellers could accelerate toward 3,960 and below\n\n👇 Drop your thoughts below — where do YOU see Gold heading as markets open Monday?\n\nA) 🟢 Bullish — bounce from 4,000 support targeting 4,100+\nB) 🔴 Bearish — 4,000 breaks and we see 3,960 or lower\nC) 🔀 Ranging — consolidation before the next big move\n\nWhat's your read on Monday's open? Let's hear it! 👇\n\nFor educational purposes only. Always manage your risk.",
